{"4165210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CapybaraTD", "steam_appid": 4165210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your family against waves of human invaders in this physics-based tower defence game. Play with a 3rd person capybara pushing or throwing frogs at those silly humans to make them fall into the water! Get money and place obstacles or build towers to defend your <strong>wetland!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your family against waves of human invaders in this physics-based tower defence game. Play with a 3rd person capybara pushing or throwing frogs at those silly humans to make them fall into the water! Get money and place obstacles or build towers to defend your <strong>wetland!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Have you ever played a Tower Defense? On this one, the physics do the job for you; you place obstacles or towers in which waves of silly human invaders keep crashing into! You can also get dirty by pushing the invaders away yourself!. Or throw a rock at them. That could also work!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165210/8c805e704b3fc5f9605e64e30fa5cf3f7d4a3a9d/header.jpg?t=1783478034", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165210/619e2bd278d3ecb79a4409d0f1a9384438d5a396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783478034", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165210/619e2bd278d3ecb79a4409d0f1a9384438d5a396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783478034", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1060</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["MediaMVP"], "publishers": ["denisMVP"],